Leave Module → Leave Request

Process / Flow:

Go to leave module click leave request form

Click Apply for Leave

Select Employee

Select Leave Type

Enter From Date and To Date

Specify Duration (Full/Half/Quarter Day)

Provide Reason

Attach document if required

Click Submit.

