Define the deduction amount

Furthermore, additional settings are available for each attendance flag rule

Same as auto deduction rules for attendance flags system has provision for Absence, Shor Time, Pre-Joining and Post-Leaving deductions

Click save button to update the rules definitions

Final Settlement

Final Settlement form consists the settings for End of Service procedures

First tab selects the criteria for FnF

Next is gratuity, define the gratuity criteria if applied in organization

Gratuity Loan is also available in the system, user can define the percentage for loan if allowed

