PF Policy

Any organization with Provident Fund policy, can implement through system

Select the criteria of policy and all the validation

PF loan is also part of system, select the criteria of loan

PF withdrawal policy can also be applied

PF withdrawal options allows user to add Signatures with Designations up to 5 Levels on PF withdrawal Request Report

After all the settings click on save button

Salary Setup

