User Manual

Onboarding Module

www.flowhcm.com

Employee Onboarding

Navigate to Others Tab and click Onboarding Module

For Employee Onboarding, click on Add Employee Onboard button

Select employee from dropdown

If required to change the current station of employee for first day select YES from dropdown and select station from dropdown

If required to change the reporting time of employee for first day select YES from dropdown and enter time

If required to change the reporting Manager of employee for first day select YES from dropdown and select employee

Enter instruction for employee if required and click on Next button

Select the Onboarding template from dropdown to map tasks

System will show the tasks details and their assignees

Questionnaire template if required to map then select YES from dropdown

Select Employee Questionnaire Template from dropdown

Select either to ask the employee to fill information or not

Click SAVE button to raise a request

Onboarding Approval

Move to next tab of Onboarding Approvals

In this screen all the Employee Onboarding requests will be listed

Take action against the requests either approve or reject and enter comments

Onboarding Clearance

Move to next tab of Onboarding Clearance

Tasks assigned to employees listed in Onboarding Template will shown in this form

Detail pop up will show the Due date and Description of tasks

After completion of tasks, request can be marked completed from Action button

Onboarding Settings

Onboarding Settings form consists of multiple setup forms

Click on Onboarding Settings form

General Onboarding Settings

Onboarding request approval hierarchy can be maintained here

Functionality checks are given in this form to make it mandatory or not

Onboarding Category

Click on Add New Category button

Pop up will be visible, enter title of category

Then click save button, it will be added in the list

Onboarding Template

Click on Add Template button

Enter Template Name and click on Save Template button

Select category from dropdown and enter task name

Enter the description and select employee from dropdown to assign task

Select Due date if required and set notification type for task alert

If required file can be attached and click Save button

Employee Questionnaire

Click on Add New Question button

Enter Questionnaire Title

Check is given to either send the responses of New joiner to employees or not

Question can be entered also selected from the Question Bank by dragging the question

Toggle for every question is given to either make part of the email or not

Click on Save Question button to save template

