[SOURCE 1: Performance Module (8.2).docx]
User Manual

Performance Module

www.flowhcm.com

Performance Setup

Navigate to Others Tab and click performance

To add performance setup, click on Add New Setup button

Performance Information

Enter Performance Setup title and description

Click save to proceed

Performance Option

After saving information select next tab of performance option in setup screen

Set the parameters in performance option (Limits, weightage, restrictions etc.)

Selection of KPI choices and scoring

User Additional feedback tiles (Feedback to Manager, Strengths, Development Plan and Areas of Development)

File attachment option enable/disable in Evaluation

Raise Suggestion policy along with the title

Final score can be set slab wise according to the percentages assigned for every review type

Set request forwarding for Objective/KPI requests and click update to save

After saving the settings, expected evaluation button generates a view of evaluation form in accordance to the parameters

Objective & KPI’s

Next step is to add Section, objectives and KPI’s, click on New Section button

Add Section information and save

Click on New Objective and enter objective information, if the KPI’s are to be created by the Employee/Line Manger select YES in Allow Manager to Write KPI and click save

Add KPI details respectively

KPI start end date can be added to show on evaluation form

KPI choice description can be entered to explain the choice detail

Click save

Evaluation Guidelines

Next step you can add Guidelines/Instruction if required in Evaluation Form

Add a title and select the review type to whom the guidelines will be visible

Enter description and click on update button

Performance Review

Move to next tab that is review and click on New Review button

To add review, enter the information of Employee selection, Title, Performance Setup and Review Category

Self, Line Manager, Additional (Peers) and Final Review types are allowed to be mapped in a performance cycle of selected employees

Incase of Matrix Box Modifier Review type field will be enabled

Performance Setup if Section wise, a field will be visible “Allow to Score Section” against all Review types

Set parameters for all review types and click on Send Review button or Save as Draft

Performance Evaluation

Evaluation Tab will show the pending/completed evaluation of Employee

Grid will show all the details of Employee Review

Click on Evaluate in Action dropdown

Evaluation from will be visible as per parameters set

User can score and add comments through this form

Additional employee feedback tiles are also available to fill

In the end weightage and final score will be shown as per user scoring

Click on Submit Performance Evaluation button

Performance Approval

In case of routing process, creation of Objective/KPI at any employee end will be approved through this TAB

The entered Objective/KPI by employee will be shown in grid in detail

The approver can either Approve/Reject the request along with adding remarks

Performance Settings

Performance Settings consists of multiple forms for setup and evaluation

Performance Template

Click on Add Template button to create a performance template

Select the criteria for template and construct a performance template

The template can be used in Objective and KPI form

KPI Library

Click on Add KPI Library to create a KPI

Add the KPI and description then click ADD

The form will create a listing of KPI called Library, used in Objective/KPI creation

Review Category

Click on Add Review category to create categories

Add the category title and description then click Add

The form will create Review Category listing, used while generating Employee review

Matrix Box

This form consists of the setting of Matrix box

Choose the Matrix process (9 or 12) fill the boxes with required information

Can even set colors of every box differently and click save

Choices for evaluation can be specified through performance option Tab

