Define Reason type and enter reason

If required file can be attached

Click Next button

Departure Arrival Details

In this Tab, select the country and city for Departure

Define the country and city for Arrival and click Next button

Travel Mode Details

In this Tab, define Travel Time

Select Travel Conveyance and class then click Next button

Pick & Drop Details

In this Tab, Pick and Drop details will be entered

If required select Yes and enter details and click Next button

Accommodation Details

In this Tab, Accommodation details will be entered separately

Enter the required Company and Personal accommodation details

Click Submit button to raise a requisition

Helpdesk Module

Ticket Request

For Ticket Request, click on Add Ticket Request

Select the employee from dropdown and enter Ticket Title

Select the category, Type and Priority of the ticket from dropdowns

Enter description for the ticket and upload attachment if required then submit the request

The system will also show Ticket History of the selected employee

The User can see the requested Ticket in the grid, go on action button to view the ticket or cancel the request

Ticket Request screen has a brief dashboard as well, click on Show Status Bar

Ticket Resolution

This screen is for the agents to resolve the assigned tickets

Click on Action button to view the ticket

Agent can change the Ticket status, add a description and also reply to the requester

Reply functionality contains tagging employees that part of that ticket

Ticket Resolution screen also has a Status Bar dashboard

Ticket Involvement

Agent or Requester can involve any employee in the ticket as well

Click on Involve Employee and Select employee from dropdown and a reason to involve

After the employee is involved, the request will be seen in this screen

Click on action button to view the ticket and perform required action

Ticket screen show all this history of action

Desk Management Module

Desk Request

To add Desk Request, click on Add New Request button

Fill out the information (Employee, Office, Floor, Room and Dates) to see the availability of seats in that particular office

Enter reason for request and then click on submit button

Training Module

Training Request

To add Training Request, click on Add Training Request button

Select the employee/employees from dropdown

Next Select the category and Template from dropdowns

Enter preferred Date & Time for training

Enter reason for request and then click on submit button

