Assistant: **Creating an Exit Interview Questionnaire for Resigning Employees** 1. **Navigate to the Exit Interview Template Tab** - Go to the **Employee Separation Settings** tab. - Click on the **Exit Interview Template** section. 2. **Add a New Template** - Click the **Add Exit Interview Template** button. - A pop‑up will appear for you to enter the template details. 3. **Enter Exit Interview Details** - Fill in the required fields for the questionnaire (e.g., title, description, questions). - Once all details are entered, click the **submit** button to save the template. 4. **Use the Template in an Employee Exit** - When creating an **Employee Exit** request, select the newly created template from the **Exit Interview** dropdown. - The questionnaire will be presented to the interviewers for completion. Follow these steps to set up a structured exit interview questionnaire that can be reused for all resigning employees.
