Select Employee and new Shift details.

[SOURCE 3: Attendance Module (5.10).docx]
Remote Work Request

Submit requests for remote work with in/out times and optional attachments.

⦁ Click Add New Request.

⦁ Select employee and remote work date(s).

⦁ Enter In & Out date and Time In & Out, add reason and attachment if needed.

⦁ Click Submit.

[SOURCE 4: Recruitment Module (5.10).docx]
User Manual

Recruitment Module

www.flowhcm.com

Job Request

Click on Recruitment on the top navigation bar

You can see the Job Request form

To add Job request, click on Apply for Job Request

Select the required data from dropdowns for the Job

Select skill set required and No. of positions

Job can be assigned to any specific employee for screening from Assign to Employee dropdown

Enter required Candidate Salary and Age range

A target joining date of candidate can be selected for the recruiter to be notified

Attachment feature is also available

Enter the required Job Experience, Description and Qualification of candidate

Click on submit button to raise a requisition

Request can be seen in grid along with some Action button features

View Report

To view the data of grid in Job Request form click on view report

Job Request Report will pop up on screen

Job Post

To add a Job Post, click on Add Job Post

Select Job Opening Field Template and Pipeline from dropdowns

User can either use the Job request data that will fill all the fields automatically else apply the same process as in Job Request fill all fields manually

Enter a closing date of applying for the Job Post

There is a feature of Job Portal in Recruitment Module, the Job will be published on the portal and candidate can apply online. If required select YES in Publish on Portal dropdown

The Job Portal allows (check basis) candidate to create an account for application tracking and dashboard - -  Candidate Portal

Then click on submit to raise a requisition

The system will then generate a link and QR code that can be posted on social platforms for candidates to apply online

Request can be seen in grid along with some Action button features

Job Portal

By accessing the link or QR code provided it will route on the Job Portal

The Published Job Post can be seen on the Job Portal with details entered

Candidate can apply for job simply by clicking on Start Application

To see the other job post of organization, click on Home button

The Portal shows the list of all Jon Posts

Candidate can view the details by clicking on Apply Now button or search the required Job title in the search bar

Top right of the screen share button is given that provides a QR code and link to directly access the Job portal list

Candidate Portal

If the check for Candidate Portal is ON while applying for the position the system will show a pop for login else already having an account the candidate will Sign In

The pop shows 2 options, First to Create Account Second to Continue as Guest (check basis). Applying as guest will directly route towards the application form

By clicking in Create Account, system requires brief details and email verification

Captcha is added for security and avoid data breach

Filling the details and clicking on Create Account button, system will send a verification code on the entered email

After verification the account will be created, the candidate needs to Sign In using the credentials that were defined

Candidate Sign In will route towards the Dashboard of Candidate Portal

Candidate can see all the job openings and track their application

Click on Apply Now button to fill application for position, enter the required details for the Job Post and click on Submit Application button

Application form now has ease to drag and drop files

The Dashboard will show the Job Card with details and Status, whenever candidate application will be moved in Screening the Candidate dashboard will show status and notify as well

Interview can be re-scheduled through system request (check basis)

Task Dashboard in Portal will show all the required tasks to be fulfilled by the candidate such as Document upload, Offer Accept/Reject etc. Furthermore, the candidate can change the password of portal and edit the profile as well that will automatically fill the Application form if allowed by the candidate

The organization can list their Vision/Goals in the bottom of dashboard

View Report

To view the data of grid in Job Post form click on view report

Job Post Report will pop up on screen

Job Candidate

To add a Candidate, click on Add Job Candidate

Select the template and then click Add

The form is divided into Three Tabs accordingly

Fill out the details in fields and selection from dropdowns

Then click on submit

The candidate’s data can be seen in grid, click on Action button for additional features

Click on Apply for Job to make part of any ongoing screening

The candidates applying online through Job/Candidate Portal will automatically fill the grid and be part of Screening process

Applications through Candidate Portal have an additional Tab of documents

Any candidate can be marked Blacklisted through Job candidate form

Upload Excel

If required, upload all candidate data in one go user can use upload excel

Click on Upload Excel button, pop up will be visible

Select the Job Opening Field Template and click on Next

Then click on Download Sample Template and enter required data

Click on choose file and then click on Save button to upload all Worksheets

Process Resume

This feature will parse all the resumes of candidates for CV parsing in screening form

System will also list down the candidates against no resumes are found

Screening

To see all the Job Posts (Open/Closed) progress, click on Screening

The form will show all the Job Posts along with the count of applications on each pipeline tile

Click on any Job Post to perform further actions

Applicant Job cards can be moved like widgets between the tiles

Every tile on screening perform different functionality and show the progress of candidate

CV Parsing

Click on Search icon to enable the search bar for keyword

Enter the required keyword, the system will parse all the data and filter the candidates from Applied tile

Apply Shortlisting Score

Apply Shortlisting Score feature provides the candidates from Applied tile through filter criteria

Select the required data from dropdowns and give marking

Keyword search can also be processed

Click next to filter the candidates, select the candidates required

Move the selected candidates to another pipeline tile

List for Test

Candidate on List for Test file

Marks for test and attachment option is available

Manager Shortlisting

Manager Shortlisting tile feature allows to send multiple candidates to an employee

Then employee can view the details of each candidate and shortlist them

Schedule Interview

Schedule Interview tile feature allows to select candidates to be scheduled for interview

Then the employee can schedule the interviews of candidates

Interview (1st, 2nd, 3rd ....)

Interview tiles feature allows to schedule an interview

Interview details can be entered and click Save button

Hiring Approval

Hiring Approval tile features to send candidates to an employee

The employee can view the details of candidates and approve or reject

Offer

Offer tile feature allows to place candidates to show final selection

If Letter module is enabled then offer can also be placed to candidate

Recruit

The candidate that have been finalized can be moved to Recruit tile

Pop up will be visible to select the Station for candidate

Reject

Candidates that have been rejected can be placed in Reject tile

For every candidate comment can be entered

Dropout

Candidates that have been Dropped from screening process can be placed in Dropout tile

For every candidate comment can be entered

Additional Features

The screening process provides some additional features for smooth process

Document Request, Hold & Blacklist Candidate and Notes

Document Request

User can request from the candidate during the screening process that will be reflected on the candidate portal and approved/rejected through system once it’s been uploaded

Hold Candidate

This feature allows user to Hold a candidate in the screening process, the application will now be at a halt state cannot move in any tile or action being performed until the candidate is released

Notes

User can enter notes/comments against an application for keeping track of screening process.

