[SOURCE 5: Payroll Module (5.10).docx]
User Manual

Payroll Module

www.flowhcm.com

Payroll Setup

Click on Payroll on the top navigation bar

Here you can see the Payroll Setup form

The form consists of multiple forms

Pay Schedule

Select the pay criteria for the payroll setup (Monthly/Weekly/Bi-weekly)

Enter the Start and End date for employee payroll

To add a new Payroll Setup, click on Plus (+) sign a pop will be visible, enter Setup name and if required to copy from another setup select YES in dropdown then click on save button

To delete any Payroll Setup, click on Minus (-) sign a confirmation pop up will be visible, enter YES then click on Yes button

To update any Payroll Setup Title, click on edit button a pop up will be visible, enter the title and then click on UPDATE button

Payroll Option

Select the functionality of Payroll Options from dropdowns

Select the calculation methods of salary

From dropdowns select the currency of Payroll and Remit

In Pay slip Options header select all the required data to be shown on the Pay slip to the employee

Payroll Summary Options allows user to add Signatures with Designations up to 5 Levels on Payroll Summary Report

After all the settings click on save button

Pay slip Items

In this form the Salary breakup of the employees in this Payroll Setup is defined

Select the Basic salary type from dropdown and enter the percentage

Further the remaining the salary is entered in Allowances

For deductions select from dropdown then select deduction type and enter amount/percentage of that deduction

In case of EOBI in deduction an additional option is available, click on the Plus (+) sign a pop up will be visible select the criteria and click on save button

Tax Slabs

Click on Update Tax Slabs button

System will show the current Tax Slabs maintained by the Government of Pakistan

Then click on save button, the tax deduction will be processed accordingly

Salary Setting

This form consists of settings for Advance Salary and Salary Chane request

Select the criteria from dropdowns

Then click on save button

Overtime

Overtime form allows you select the criteria of overtime calculation and settings of hours

Criteria can be different for Working and non-working day, Holiday etc.

[SOURCE 6: Leave Module (5.10).docx]
Leave Encashment and Accrual rules configurable (salary-based formulas).

