[SOURCE 1: Travel Module (5.10).docx]
Travel Request

Employees can create new travel requests by entering general travel details, destinations, travel modes, and other required information for approval.

⦁ Navigate to Others Tab and click on Travel Module

⦁ The Travel Request form will appear

⦁ Click on Add New Request button

⦁ The form is divided into multiple groups to fill details step by step

⦁ After completing all sections, click on Submit button to finalize the request

General Details

This section captures basic travel information such as travel mode, employee details, dates, and purpose.

⦁ Enter the Travel Mode and select the employee

⦁ Define Start Date and End Date

⦁ Select Reason Type from dropdown

⦁ Enter a Description and attach files if required

⦁ Click on Next button to proceed

Departure/Arrival Details

This section collects information related to travel destinations and locations.

⦁ Select Country and City from dropdowns

⦁ Click Next button to move to the next section

Travel Mode Details

This section defines how the travel will be conducted, including mode, class, and timings.

⦁ Define Travel Time, Mode, and Class from dropdowns

⦁ Click Next button to proceed

Pick & Drop Details

This section allows entering pickup and drop-off arrangements if transportation support is required.

⦁ If required, select YES from the dropdown to enable pick & drop fields

⦁ Enter all necessary information in the fields

⦁ For multiple entries, click Add New Line button

⦁ Click Next button to continue

Accommodation Details

This section records accommodation requirements and duration during the travel.

⦁ Select whether Company or Personal Accommodation is required

⦁ Enter Start Date and End Date

⦁ Click Next button to proceed

Travel Advance Expense

If enabled in system configuration, users can request advance travel expenses along with their travel request.

⦁ This form appears only if the system configuration option is enabled

⦁ Enter the required advance expense information

⦁ Click Submit button to finalize the request

View Report

Enables viewing of submitted travel requests in report format.

⦁ Click on View Report button in the Travel Request form

⦁ The Travel Request Report will appear in a popup window displaying the requested data

Travel Approvals

Used to review, approve, or reject travel requests submitted by employees.

⦁ Navigate to Travel Approvals form

⦁ Select criteria for specific requests and click Apply

⦁ System fills the grid with the filtered data

⦁ Requests can be Accepted or Rejected accordingly

Travel Settings

Contains all configuration and setup forms related to travel management such as approval hierarchy and reason types.

⦁ Click on Travel Settings form to open configuration options

General Travel Settings

Used to define the approval hierarchy and minimum day validation for travel requests.

⦁ Configure the Request Approval Hierarchy

⦁ Enter the Minimum Days value to validate travel requests

⦁ Click Save button to store the settings

Travel Reason Type

Used to define and manage travel reasons available for selection in travel requests.

⦁ Navigate to Travel Reason Type form under Travel Settings

⦁ Click on Add New Type button (popup will appear)

⦁ Enter the Reason Name

⦁ Click Save button to add the new travel reason

