[SOURCE 1: Employee Separation Module (5.10).docx]
User Manual

Employee Separation Module

www.flowhcm.com

Employee Exit

Navigate to Others Tab and click Employee Separation

You can see the Employee Exit form

To add Employee Exit, click on Apply for Employee Exit

Select Employee and Exit type from dropdowns

Enter the leaving date of employee

If Clearance is required select YES and then select a required clearance template if exists else select OTHER in template and set an approval hierarchy along with the Questions filled with every level

If Exit interview is required select YES and then select a required Exit template and select interviewers

Select an employee for evaluation

Enter Interview Date, Time and Place

If required for the employee to be inactive immediately not after Final Settlement select NO in Inactive Employee After FnF else select YES

There is another option to either restrict User login or not, if required select YES

Enter a reason for Employee Exit and attach a file if any

Click on submit button to raise a requisition

Upload Excel

If required, upload all Employee Exits in one go user can use upload excel

Click on Upload Excel button, pop up will be visible

Then click on Download Sample Template and enter required data

Click on choose file and then click on Save button to upload all Employee Exits

Final Settlement

Here you can see Final Settlement form

Click on Run Final settlement button

Select criteria for Final settlement and then click on preview button

After clicking on preview, the system will show the FnF details of selected employees

Click on Save to proceed button after viewing the details

Final settlement grid will be populated with the entry

Click on Action button click on Disburse else delete if any changes required

Disbursing the settlement will show a pop up for confirmation select Yes to continue

Add Month, Year and Reason in which Final Settlement needs to be disbursed

Month, Year and Disbursed details will change in grid after saving

Employee Clearance

Here you can see Employee Clearance form

When Employee Exit will be submitted with clearance, the request will fall in Employee Clearance grid

Can use filter criteria to view required data in grid

Click on clearance pop up to view the template

Clearance can be processed by Action button, view and download features are also available

Exit Interview

Here you can see Exit Interview form

When Employee Exit will be submitted with exit interview, the request will fall in Exit Interview grid

Can use filter criteria to view required data in grid

Click on evaluate button to view the evaluation

Enter all the comments against the questions

Then click on submit button

Employee Separation Approvals

Moving to the next Tab Employee Separation Approvals

Employee Exit requests that are set on approval hierarchy will fall in this Employee Separation Approvals grid

Can use filter criteria to view required data in grid

Click the maximize button to view the details

Approve or Reject the request from Action button

Employee Separation Settings

Moving to the next Tab Employee Separation Settings, this Tab consists of multiple settings

General Settings

Click on General Settings, Final Settlement and Clearance settings are given

Final settlement settings allow to set approval hierarchy for FnF request

Clearance setting has option to send request of clearance to all selected users at once instead of hierarchy (one by one) set in Employee exit request

After the settings are done click on save button

Clearance Template

Moving to the next Tab Clearance Template in General settings

In this form templates for clearance can be created beforehand and then just select from dropdown of clearance template in Employee Exit

Click on Add Clearance Template to create templates

Enter clearance details and then click on submit button to save the template and then just select the template from dropdown in Employee Exit

Questionnaire Category

In this Tab questionnaire category can be added

Click on Add New Category button, a pop up will be visible

Enter the category title then click on save button

Exit Interview Template

Moving to the next Tab Exit Interview Template in General settings

Click on Add Exit Interview Template to create templates

Enter exit interview details and then click on submit button to save the template and then just select the template from dropdown in Employee Exit

