[SOURCE 2: Leave Module.docx]
Leave Settings

Configuration section for all leave-related policies, quotas, and approval workflows. Navigation Path:
Leave Module → Leave Settings

Sub-sections:

4.1 General Leave Settings

Compensation Leave Forwarding: Set approval hierarchy and auto-approve rules

Leave Quota Settings: Configure quota start date (default January 1)

Compensation Leave Settings: Set hours required for one compensation leave day

Station Leave Setting: Enable/disable station address requirement

Leave Report Signatures: Add up to 5 signatures with designations

4.2 Leave Type Setting

Add Leave Type: Create and configure leave types with detailed parameters:

Title, Leave Entitled count

Employee Status, Group, Gender restrictions

Paid Leave settings

Sandwich/Club days deduction rules

Leave Encashment options

Leave Accrual methods

Carry Forward limits

Attachment requirements

Monthly leave limits

Advance request requirements

Consecutive day rules

Approval level types

Leave duration options

4.3 Employee Leave Quota

Assign and manage leave quotas for employees

Filter by employee and leave type

View Company Wise vs Employee Wise quotas

Modify and update individual employee quotas

Key Features:

Comprehensive leave policy configuration

Flexible quota management

Multi-level approval routing

Advanced leave type customization

Troubleshooting:

"Quota Not Assigning" → Verify employee status and group assignments

"Approval Routing Error" → Ensure reporting managers are properly assigned

