System will automatically show the currency

There are multiple toggle buttons to enter details, to define overtime and short time rates of an employee enable the toggle buttons and enter the required information

Same process for payment details of an employee

Enter the monthly salary of the employee, system will automatically distribute the amount according to the salary breakup defined in Payroll Setup

Furthermore, if any recurring Allowances or Deductions need to be entered, enable the toggle button and enter the required data for calculations

System will show the Estimated Monthly Salary of the employee

After all settings click on save button

Upload Excel

If required, upload all employee salary in one go user can use upload excel

Click on Upload Excel button, pop up will be visible

Then click on Download Sample Template and enter required data

Click on choose file and then click on Save button to upload all employee salary

Process Payroll

To calculate the income of employees, click on Run Payroll button in the Process Payroll form

Select the filter criteria for employees, enable the required toggle buttons then click on Preview button

System will list down the employees according to the filter selection along with their payroll information

List allows provision to download all pay slips in PDF and Excel report

Click on Save button if don’t want to disburse salaries else click on Save and Disburse button

Send Pay slip Email

To send the pay slips of employees all in one go lick on Send Pay slip Email button

Pop up will be shown on screen, select the filter criteria and then click on Send button

Payroll Approvals

All the requests of Payroll Module will fall in Payroll Approval form

User can select criteria for specific requests and click Apply button

System will fill the grid with required data

Pay slip Approvals

All the requests related to pay slip items will fall in Pay slip Approval form

User can select criteria for specific requests and click Apply button

System will fill the grid with required data

Advance Salary Request

To add an Advance Salary Request, click on Apply for Advance salary button

Select an employee and enter tile for request

System will automatically show history of Advance Salary requests of the selected employee

Select a date and enter amount of advance salary required

Enter a reason

Then click on submit to raise a requisition

Upload Excel

If required, upload all Advance Salary entries in one go user can use upload excel

Click on Upload Excel button, pop up will be visible

Then click on Download Sample Template and enter required data

Click on choose file and then click on Save button to upload all Advance Salary entries

View Report

To view the data of grid in Advance Salary Request form click on view report

Advance Salary Report will pop up on screen

Leave Encashment Request

To add a Leave Encashment Request, click on Create Encashment button in Leave Encashment Request form

Select the filter criteria for employees and their leaves

Then click on Preview button, system will list down all the data of employees Leave encashment

Manual intervention is allowed in leave to increase/decrease the count of leaves against all leave types

Then click on submit to raise a requisition

