To add an Overtime Request, click on Apply for overtime in Overtime Request form

Select an employee and enter Title

Select date that will enable the desired overtime type field to enter hours

Enter a reason for Overtime Request

Then click on submit to raise a requisition

Multiple Overtime Request

To add Multiple Overtime Requests, click on Apply for multiple overtime in Overtime Request form

Select the filter criteria and then click on apply button

System will list down the data according to the criteria selected

Edit the hours if required else system will show the hours according to the policy

Select a reason for every Request and enter Remarks

Then click on submit to raise a requisition

