[SOURCE 3: Expense Module (5.10).docx]
User Manual

Expense Module

www.flowhcm.com

Expense Request

Navigate to Others Tab and click Expense Module

For Expense Request, click on Apply for Expense

Select employee, category, month and year for expense

Incase of request against advance select Yes in dropdown

Set date and type of expense, enter amount

User can add multiple lines in a single request

System will show employees quota summary and history of expense in Table form

Attach a file if required and check or uncheck include in payroll option

Enter description and then submit the request

Upload Excel

If required, upload all expense requests in one go user can use upload excel

Click on Upload Excel button, pop up will be visible

Then click on Download Sample Template and enter required data

Click on choose file and then click on Save button to upload all Expense requests

View Report

To view the data of grid in Expense Request form click on view report

Expense Request Report will pop up on screen

Advance Expense Request

For Advance Expense Request, click on Apply for Advance Expense

Select employee, category, month and year for request

Set date and type of expense, enter amount

User can add multiple lines in a single request

Attach a file if required

Enter description and then submit the request

Advance Adjustment

For Advance Adjustment Request, click on Apply for Advance Adjustment

Select the employee and Category from dropdowns

Define the type, system will show the Remaining amount

Select the Operation from dropdown (Increment/Adjustment) and enter the amount

Define a date and enter a reason for request

Then click on submit to raise a requisition

Expense Approvals

Move to next tab of Expense Approvals

In this screen all the expense requests will be listed

Take action against the requests either approve or reject and enter comments

Expense Settings

Expense Setting form consists of multiple setup forms

Click on Expense Settings form

Expense Category

Click on Add Expense Category button

Pop up will be visible, enter title of category

Select either this type will be used against Advance Expense or not

Define either it will be included in payslip or not or both for user preference

Can be Auto or Multi-level approval based

Approval type can be Specific Employee or other

Then click save button, it will be added in the list

Expense Type

Move to Expense Type tab, click on Add Expense type button

Enter Expense Type Title

Set all the parameters for that type then save

Type will be added in the list

Expense Quota

To create Expense Quota, click on Expense Quota form

Select the required criteria and click on Apply button

Then click on Create Expense Quota

System will generate Expense Quota in accordance to the policy of Expense type

Expense details are shown in grid, click on Update Leave Quota to assign quota

Expense Rate

To add Expense Rate, click on Add Expense Rate

A pop will be visible select the Title and employees from dropdown and enter the rate

Define Month and Year for Allowance Rate then click Save

Upload Excel

If required, upload all expense rate in one go user can use upload excel

Click on Upload Excel button, pop up will be visible

Then click on Download Sample Template and enter required data

Click on choose file and then click on Save button to upload all Expense rate

Copy Expense Rate

To copy defined expense rates for upcoming duration click on Copy Expense Rate button

Pop up will be visible, select the criteria and click on Save button

Expense Distance Mapping

Click on Add Expense Distance button

Select the Expense Type, City From and City To from dropdowns

Enter the distance so that it will be calculated with the rate and unit

Multiple lines can be added

Click Save button

General Expense Settings

Define the start date of Expense Quota in Expense Quota settings Tab

Then click on save button

