[SOURCE 7: Employee Module (5.10).docx]
User Manual

Employee Module

www.flowhcm.com

Employee List

Click on Employee on the top navigation bar

Here you can see the Employee list form

The form consists of multiple functions/buttons

Add New Employee

To add New Employee, click on Add New Employee button

The forms is divided into group information to be filled

After filling all the details click on submit button

General Information

The form contains the general information of employee

That will be used throughout the system

Fill the details and then click on Next button

Additional Information

The form will be filled with additional information of employee

Details such as Contact, Bank, Emergency information etc. that is required by the organizational documentation

Fill the details and then click on Next button

Company Information

The form will be filled with the Company mapping of employee

Employee stationed as & where and appointment information

Fill the details and then click on Next button

Employee Documents

In this form employee documents can be added

To neglect the paper work, upload all documents

Salary Information

This form will be filled with Salary information of employee

All payable setups will be defined (Overtime – Allowance – Deduction – Salary breakup)

Click on Save button after details are entered

Send Credentials

If required, to send employee application credentials in one go

Click on Send Credentials button, pop up will be visible

Select the criteria of employee’s

Then click on Save button to send the credentials to selected employees

Re-Hire Employee

System has a provision to re-hire any employee

Click on Re-Hire Employee button, pop up will be visible

Search the employee by CNIC No. and click on Search button

Employee will be visible in Inactive Employee dropdown

Select the employee and click on Rehire button the form will be visible with data

Change the required data and then click on Rehire button

Upload Excel

If required, upload all employee data in one go user can use upload excel

Click on Upload Excel button, pop up will be visible

Then click on Download Sample Template and enter required data

Click on choose file and then click on Save button to upload all employee data

Export Data

To export all data of employee from system into one file

Click on Export Data button, pop up will be visible

Select the required data and click on Export button

Employee Profile Request

To add an Employee Profile Request, click on Add New Employee

Employee form will be visible, fill all the data then click on Save button

The requisition will be submitted

Employee Transfer

To add Employee Transfer Request, click on Apply for Employee Transfer

Select employee, Type and date for transfer

System will auto fill the fields with current data of employee

Enter the required changes in data, a table is also visible to track data

After details are entered add a description against request

Then click on submit to raise a requisition

Employee Role

Employee Role form consists of multiple template forms

Employee Role

Employee Role form allows to change user rights within the application

Select the employee from dropdown

Either click on Apply Role template and map a certain template from list or can change rights manually module wise

After changes click on Save button

Copy Role

Copy Role form allows you to copy template from a user to another

Select the required employees from dropdowns

Then click on Save button

Role Templates

Role Template form allows to either create a new or change any current template

Click on Create New template and adjust rights

Else select template from dropdown and make changes to that template

Then click on Save Template button

Employee Info Request

To add an Info Request, click on Employee Info Request form

Click on Apply for Employee Info button

Select Employee from dropdown, system will autofill fields

User can only change the data in enabled fields

After the changes click on Submit request to raise a requisition

Employee Resignation

To add a Resignation Request, click on Employee Resignation form

Click on Add New Request button

Select Employee and Resignation date

Define resignation reason and enter Last working date

File can be attached if required

Enter a reason for request then click on Submit button to raise a requisition

View Report

To view the data of grid in Employee Resignation form click on view report

Resignation Request Report will pop up on screen

Suggestions

To add a Suggestion Request, click on Add New Suggestion

Enter Suggestion Title and Select category from dropdown

Select either the suggestion should be sent anonymously or not

Define the suggestion in box

Then click on submit to raise a requisition

Employee Approvals

All the requests of Employee Module will fall in Employee Approval form

User can select criteria for specific requests and click Apply button

System will fill the grid with required data

Amend Employee Department

To make amendments in Employee Departments, click on Amend Employee Department form

Select the criteria & Date range (From – To) and click on apply button

System will show the required data on grid

Check mark the rows that needs changes, select the department from dropdown then click Save button

The selected rows will be saved with entered data

Apply Same Department

If required, to map same department to multiple employee select the required rows

Then click on Apply Same Department button, a pop up will be visible

Select the department to be mapped then click on save button

Employee Setting

Employee Setting form consists of multiple setup forms

Click on Employee Setting form

Employee Info Approval Setting

To setup the enable field data in Employee Info request, click on Employee Info Approval Settings form in Employee Settings

Name of fields are listed, select the toggle to enable the fields and set a approval

Then click on Save button

Employee Field Mandatory Settings

To set mandatory fields in Employee List, click on Employee Filed Mandatory Settings form in Employee Settings

Name of fields are listed within the Tabs, select the toggle to mark the fields mandatory

User can also see the history by clicking on View History Button

Then click on Save button

Suggestion Category

To add a Category for Suggestions, click on Suggestion Category form in Employee Settings

Click on Add Suggestion Category button, pop up will be visible

Enter Category Title and select Suggest Anonymously YES/NO

Select the intimation platform for suggestion (Notification/Email) and define the users as well from dropdowns

Then click on Save button

General Employee Setting

General Employee Settings form consists of request approval hierarchy

For every setting click Save button

