[SOURCE 5: Asset Module (5.10).docx]
Asset Request

Navigate to Others Tab and click Asset Module

You can see the Asset Request form

To add Asset request, click on Apply for New Asset

Select employee from dropdown and enter asset title

Select Asset category & type, enter description for request

Click on submit button to raise a requisition

If required, upload all Asset requests in one go user can use upload excel

Click on Upload Excel button, pop up will be visible

Then click on Download Sample Template and enter required data

Click on choose file and then click on Save button to upload all Asset requests

Asset Return Request

To add an Asset return Request, click on Apply for Return Asset

Select an employee from dropdown

Select Asset type from dropdown

Enter description for request

Then click on submit to raise a requisition

If required, upload all Asset return requests in one go user can use upload excel

Click on Upload Excel button, pop up will be visible

Then click on Download Sample Template and enter required data

Click on choose file and then click on Save button to upload all Asset return requests

Asset Approvals

All asset requests and returns are listed for approval, where users can accept or reject and provide comments. All the requests of Asset Module will fall in Asset Approvals form

User can select criteria for specific requests and click Apply button

System will fill the grid with required data

User can either Accept or Reject the requests and enter comments against it

Asset Hand Over

Facilitates assigning assets to employees, including defining type (permanent/temporary), serial numbers, and dates. To allow asset against an Asset Request, move to Asset Hand Over & Take Over form

The grid will show all the Asset and Asset return requests

In case of Asset request click on Allow asset in Action button

Define the Asset Type (Permanent or Temporary) – Temporary case: date range will be entered

Enter the check in date and Serial Number of Asset that will be Handed Over

Enter remarks then click on submit to map the asset against requisition

Asset Take Over

Handles returning assets from employees, capturing check-out dates and remarks to unmap the asset from the requisition. To return asset against an Asset Return Request, move to Asset Hand Over & Take Over form

The grid will show all the Asset and Asset return requests

In case of Asset return request click on Return asset in Action button

Enter the check out date of Asset that will be Taken Over

Enter remarks then click on submit to unmap the asset against return requisition

Asset Settings

Contains all setup forms for managing asset configurations, categories, types, and templates.

