[SOURCE 5: Attendance Module (5.10).docx]
Amend Employee Shift

Edit employee shift assignments in bulk for a date range.

⦁ Open Amend Employee Shift form.

⦁ Select employees & date range → click Apply.

⦁ Check rows, select new shift → click Save Shift. Apply Same Shift

Assign the same shift to multiple selected employees.

⦁ Select rows → click Apply Same Shift → choose shift in popup → click Save Shift. Copy Shift

Copy shift assignments from one month to another for selected employees.

⦁ Click Copy Shift → select From and To month → click Next.

⦁ Select employees and shifts (OFF shifts visible) → click Save.

