[SOURCE 3: Attendance Module (5.10).docx]
Attendance Request

Employees can raise attendance requests by selecting employee, date, times, and reason; requests are submitted for approval.

⦁ Click Attendance on the top navigation bar.

⦁ Open the Attendance Request form.

⦁ Click Add New Request.

⦁ Select employee and attendance date.

⦁ Enter In & Out time, select attendance type, and enter reason.

⦁ Click Submit to raise a requisition.

[SOURCE 4: Onboarding Module (5.10).docx]
User Manual

Onboarding Module

www.flowhcm.com

Employee Onboarding

Navigate to Others Tab and click Onboarding Module

For Employee Onboarding, click on Add Employee Onboard button

Select employee from dropdown

If required to change the current station of employee for first day select YES from dropdown and select station from dropdown

If required to change the reporting time of employee for first day select YES from dropdown and enter time

If required to change the reporting Manager of employee for first day select YES from dropdown and select employee

Enter instruction for employee if required and click on Next button

Select the Onboarding template from dropdown to map tasks

System will show the tasks details and their assignees

Questionnaire template if required to map then select YES from dropdown

Select Employee Questionnaire Template from dropdown

Select either to ask the employee to fill information or not

Click SAVE button to raise a request

Onboarding Approval

Move to next tab of Onboarding Approvals

In this screen all the Employee Onboarding requests will be listed

Take action against the requests either approve or reject and enter comments

Onboarding Clearance

Move to next tab of Onboarding Clearance

Tasks assigned to employees listed in Onboarding Template will shown in this form

Detail pop up will show the Due date and Description of tasks

After completion of tasks, request can be marked completed from Action button

Onboarding Settings

Onboarding Settings form consists of multiple setup forms

Click on Onboarding Settings form

General Onboarding Settings

Onboarding request approval hierarchy can be maintained here

Functionality checks are given in this form to make it mandatory or not

Onboarding Category

Click on Add New Category button

Pop up will be visible, enter title of category

Then click save button, it will be added in the list

Onboarding Template

Click on Add Template button

Enter Template Name and click on Save Template button

Select category from dropdown and enter task name

Enter the description and select employee from dropdown to assign task

Select Due date if required and set notification type for task alert

If required file can be attached and click Save button

Employee Questionnaire

Click on Add New Question button

Enter Questionnaire Title

Check is given to either send the responses of New joiner to employees or not

Question can be entered also selected from the Question Bank by dragging the question

Toggle for every question is given to either make part of the email or not

Click on Save Question button to save template

[SOURCE 5: ESS User Manual.docx]
User Manual

Employee Self Service

www.flowhcm.com

Attendance Module

Attendance Request

To add attendance request, click on Add New Request

Select employee and Attendance date

Enter In & Out time, select attendance type and enter reason for request

Click on submit button to raise a requisition

Irregular Attendance Request

To add Irregular Attendance Request, click on Add Irregular Attendance Request

Select the date range and attendance type, click on Apply to populate the grid

Select the required row and enter data as per need

Then click on submit button to raise a request

View Report

To view the data of grid in Attendance Request form click on view report

Attendance Request Report will pop up on screen

Exemption Request

To add an Exemption Request, click on Add New Request

Select an employee and date for Exemption

Flag type will be visible automatically by system

Select Exemption Type and enter Reason for request

Then click on submit to raise a requisition

View Report

To view the data of grid in Exemption Request form click on view report

Exemption Request Report will pop up on screen

Worksheet

To add a Worksheet, click on Add New Worksheet

Select an employee and date for Worksheet

Enter title of Worksheet

Select Project form dropdown, Start & End date will be fetched from Worksheet date

Enter Start and End time of the work done

Enter description for Worksheet Request

Then click on submit to raise a requisition

Remote Work Request

To add a Remote Work Request, click on Add New Request

Select an employee and date for Remote Work

Enter In & Out date and Time In & Out for Remote Work Request

Enter a reason for requisition

User can also upload an attachment if required

Then click on submit to raise a requisition

Shift Request

To add a Shift Request, click on Add New Request

Select an employee and date for Shift Request

System will automatically show the Current shift of employee

Select the Desired Shift from dropdown

Enter a reason for Shift Request

Then click on submit to raise a requisition

Leave Module

Leave Request

To add Leave request, click on Apply for Leave

Select employee and Leave Type

